@title  PCSE00235 - boot through the intro movie (probe; NOT yet a gameplay recipe)
@game   PCSE00235

# WHAT THIS RECIPE IS FOR
# ----------------------
# A BOOT PROBE for Dead or Alive 5 Plus while it is being brought up. It presses nothing
# until the intro movie has had time to finish, then taps start/cross looking for a way on.
#
# WHAT A RUN OF THIS LOOKS LIKE (2026-09-24, desktop headless):
#   f000000-f000590  black: the title draws only a full-screen fade quad (verified with a
#                    capsule replay - near-zero alpha over the clear), which is its own
#                    loading screen, not a render fault
#   f000600-f001500  the Team Ninja intro movie `ninja_vi.mp4` (AVC + AAC, 20 s) plays
#   f001667          the autosave notice (a MsgDialog, answered OK)
#   f001700+         BLACK AND IDLE - the game draws one fade quad a frame and waits; the
#                    presses below change nothing. OPEN: see agent notes 2026-09-24a B.
#
# There is deliberately no @sig: the frontier is not settled.

0: @section boot

# After the movie and the autosave notice.
1800: @section probe-presses
1800: start
1860: cross
1920: start
1980: cross
2040: start
2100: cross
2160: start
2220: cross
2280: start
2340: cross
2400: start
2460: cross
2520: start
2580: cross
2640: start
2700: cross
2760: start
2820: cross
2880: start
2940: cross
3000: start
3060: cross
3120: start
3180: cross
3240: start
3300: cross
3360: start
3420: cross
3480: start
3540: cross
3600: start
3660: cross
